 "brief": "A desk stand for a tablet in PLA (FDM, printed on its side, layers along Y), 70 mm wide (y = -35 to 35), inside x = 0 to 100, z = 0 to 120. The tablet (0.6 kg, 180 mm tall, 10 mm thick) leans back about 23 degrees: its bottom edge sits on a ledge near x = 10 to 24, z = 11 to 14.5 behind a front lip (x = 8 to 11, up to z = 22), and its back rests on a 5 mm round bar across the stand near x = 59, z = 94. The stand sits on the desk on a front foot (x = 0 to 12) and a rear foot (x = 88 to 100). It holds the tablet all year at room temperature, and takes taps on the top of the screen of up to 15 N. Safety factor 3.",
